      "transcript": "ਗਉੜੀ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00002",
      "start_time": 12.265,
      "end_time": 18.405,
      "transcript": "ਰਾਮ ਜਪਉ ਜੀਅ, ਐਸੇ ਐਸੇ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00003",
      "start_time": 18.405,
      "end_time": 24.7,
      "transcript": "ਧ੍ਰੂ ਪ੍ਰਹਿਲਾਦ, ਜਪਿਓ ਹਰਿ ਜੈਸੇ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00004",
      "start_time": 24.7,
      "end_time": 30.575,
      "transcript": "ਦੀਨ ਦਇਆਲ, ਭਰੋਸੇ ਤੇਰੇ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00005",
      "start_time": 31.08,
      "end_time": 38.725,
      "transcript": "ਸਭੁ ਪਰਵਾਰੁ, ਚੜਾਇਆ ਬੇੜੇ ਰਹਾਉ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00006",
      "start_time": 46.345,
      "end_time": 52.48,
      "transcript": "ਜਾ ਤਿਸੁ ਭਾਵੈ, ਤਾ ਹੁਕਮੁ ਮਨਾਵੈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00007",
      "start_time": 52.48,
      "end_time": 58.68,
      "transcript": "ਇਸ ਬੇੜੇ ਕਉ, ਪਾਰਿ ਲਘਾਵੈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00008",
      "start_time": 58.68,
      "end_time": 64.84,
      "transcript": "ਗੁਰ ਪਰਸਾਦਿ, ਐਸੀ ਬੁਧਿ ਸਮਾਨੀ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00009",
      "start_time": 64.84,
      "end_time": 70.895,
      "transcript": "ਚੂਕਿ ਗਈ, ਫਿਰਿ ਆਵਨ ਜਾਨੀ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00010",
      "start_time": 70.895,
      "end_time": 77.0,
      "transcript": "ਕਹੁ ਕਬੀਰ, ਭਜੁ ਸਾਰਿਗਪਾਨੀ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00011",
      "start_time": 77.0,
      "end_time": 83.101,
      "transcript": "ਉਰਵਾਰਿ ਪਾਰਿ, ਸਭ ਏਕੋ ਦਾਨੀ"
    },
    {
